1
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:10,640
What are the problems that students face due to dogs outside?

2
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:13,660
Students have a lot of problems.

3
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:16,200
They get lost in their room, they do poop.

4
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:21,460
As soon as the bike comes, they run after it.

5
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,200
They tear things off.

6
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:24,740
The dogs also get into trouble sometimes.

7
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:28,320
So when you are complained about, what instructions do you give?

8
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:29,920
What should be done if a dog gets in trouble at any time?

9
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:34,800
We can't do anything because we can't kill the dogs.

10
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:36,820
We just can chase them away.

11
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:39,000
We report to the police.

12
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:43,760
Because this is the only action that we take to get them caught and get them released.

13
00:00:44,620 --> 00:00:47,040
And has there ever been a child who got hurt badly?

14
00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:59,380
Both legs were damaged.

15
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:08,140
How can we stop them?

16
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,900
Yes, they are.

17
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:22,300
They should read the schedule.

18
00:01:23,220 --> 00:01:25,820
Do you take action after the complaints?

19
00:01:25,820 --> 00:01:27,080
Yes, we do.

20
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:28,160
We get late.

21
00:01:29,080 --> 00:01:29,600
It takes time.

22
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:33,120
What should be done according to your opinion?

23
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:36,260
I think they should be taken out of the hostel.

24
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:40,860
Yes, we need a house.

25
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:45,520
Many children are loving us and feeding us.

26
00:01:46,540 --> 00:01:49,320
Some kids complain that they are cutting the food.

27
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:51,940
They keep the bags inside.

28
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:55,240
And if you want to feed them, there is a feeding zone outside.

29
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,760
Do you face any problems outside the hostel due to dogs?

30
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,940
Yes, there are many problems on roads.

31
00:02:11,420 --> 00:02:12,780
What will the bike do?

32
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:14,760
Will give speed

33
00:02:15,420 --> 00:02:17,700
Dog will be angry

34
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:23,220
What should you do in general on campus according to you?

35
00:02:25,340 --> 00:02:26,360
Should go outside

36
00:02:28,890 --> 00:02:30,540
Thank You

